<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss govt sets auction for 4-1/4 pct 20-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Swiss govt sets auction for 4-1/4 pct 20-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by Swiss National Bank on behalf of the Swiss Treasury.</p>
<p> BORROWER - Swiss Government</p>
<p> AMT  max 1 bln CHF   COUPON     4-1/4     MATURITY   05.Jun.17</p>
<p> TYPE   fixed-rate    ISS PRICE  =	   PAY DATE   05.Jun.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ annual	LOCAL CODE 644 842   ACCRUAL    05.Jun.97</p>
<p>Note = Subscriptions end on May 22.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
